    old "You slip out before the gavel falls. The remaining lots are settled without you — you are %d gold richer when you count your purse."
    new "你在落锤前悄悄离场。剩余拍品在你缺席的情况下完成了交易——清点钱袋时，你多了 %d 金币。"
    old "You slip out before the gavel falls. The remaining lots are settled without you — your purse is %d gold lighter."
